  "description": "<p>Now that NonRdfSourceDescription properties are actually stored on the associated Binary resource, when the client is updating /fcr:metadata its etag (read: caching) is not affected.<br/>\nTo reproduce:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>curl -XPUT -H\"Content-Type: image/jpeg\" --data-binary @image.jpg <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/picture\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/picture</a>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Use your own jpg file</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>curl -I <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/picture/fcr:metadata\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/picture/fcr:metadata</a>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Note etag value</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>curl -i -XPATCH -H\"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\" --data-binary @update.su localhost:8080/rest/picture/fcr:metadata\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\"update.su\" is attached</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>curl -I <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/picture/fcr:metadata\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/picture/fcr:metadata</a>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Note etag has not changed</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
